@baseUrl = http://localhost:5084

### Existing sample already uses faculty 1, Monday, slot 1 (09:00-10:00).
### Create another entry using that same faculty/time in another timetable.
### Replace IDs below with valid IDs from your database.
### Expected: 409 Conflict when the requested slot overlaps 09:00-10:00.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/timetable-entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timetableId": 2,
  "timetableSlotId": 4,
  "facultyId": 1,
  "subjectId": 2,
  "sectionId": 2,
  "dayOfWeek": "MONDAY",
  "classroom": "Room 202",
  "entryType": "LECTURE",
  "createdBy": 1
}

### List faculty entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/timetable-entries?facultyId=1&dayOfWeek=MONDAY

### Update - replace 1 and request IDs with valid values
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/timetable-entries/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timetableId": 1,
  "timetableSlotId": 2,
  "facultyId": 1,
  "subjectId": 1,
  "sectionId": 1,
  "dayOfWeek": "MONDAY",
  "classroom": "Room 101",
  "entryType": "LECTURE",
  "status": true,
  "updatedBy": 1
}

### Deactivate - replace 1 with a valid timetable entry ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/timetable-entries/1
